  "bodyHash": "1e31ebd733b730d4",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/270/ss-ir3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.minecraftuser.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ff%253d13%2526t%253d25044\" rel=\"nofollow\">非官方论坛</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>IR3 是一个面向 Minecraft 1.7.10 的<span><span>独立</span></span>技术模组。本模组添加了矿石、能源系统、机器、管道、水箱、装饰物、食物和工具。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>视频(日文):</strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/RNO-kd-XkA0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>前置要求:</strong></p>\n<p>Forge #1448+</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://mods.curse.com/mc-mods/minecraft/242484-mceconomy2\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCEconomy2</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>主要</span> <span>新增内容</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>矿石</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span>作为新的</span> <span>矿石</span> <span>加入到了</span> <span>正常的</span> <span>地下结构</span>中，<span>锡</span>、<span>铜</span>、<span>银</span>将会被添加。<span>不同的</span> <span>海拔高度</span>会分别生成它们。<span>此外</span>，在<span>海洋</span>生物群系的<span>海底</span>（砾石层），作为新<span>资源</span>，会生成<span>锰结核</span>和<span>钴结壳</span>。<span>这些结壳</span>可以增加<span>挖掘</span>时的<span>运气</span>，通过<span>破碎机</span>处理<span>挖掘到的</span><span>结壳</span>即可获得<span>金属</span>。</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>高级红石信号<span><span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>高级红石信号是一种高频红石脉冲。<span><span>它拥有两个</span> <span>参数</span>：<span>信号强度</span>和<span>频率</span>。信号强度代表信号等级。<span><span>每</span> <span>经过</span> <span>1米，它会衰减</span> <span>1个单位RSS</span>。&nbsp;频率与机器的运行速度相关，频率不会衰减。</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>红石线缆<span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span><span><span>这种线缆用于传输</span> <span>开发中的</span> <span>红石</span> <span>信号</span>。<span>不同</span> <span>材质</span> <span>制作的</span> <span>线缆</span>，其能处理的<span>信号强度</span>和<span>频率</span>上限各不相同。<span>你还可以使用</span> <span>染料</span> <span>改变</span> <span>制作出的</span> <span>线缆</span> <span>的颜色</span>。<span>不同</span> <span>颜色</span> <span>的</span> <span>线缆</span>之间<span>无法</span> <span>连接</span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>红石管道<span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span><span>除了</span> <span>传输</span> <span>高级红石信号外</span>，<span>管道</span> <span>还能以每秒</span> <span>1米</span> <span>（即每个方块）</span> <span>的速度输送物品</span>。<span>通过使用</span> <span>管道</span>，可以用<span>简单的</span> <span>线路</span> <span>自动化</span> <span>加工设施</span>。<span>安装</span> <span>管道</span>时，<span>其开口方向</span> <span>将朝向</span> <span>点击过的</span> <span>表面</span>。<br> <span>管道的</span> <span>朝向</span> <span>以及</span> <span>输出管道的</span> <span>目标方块</span> <span>将作为</span> <span>选择</span> <span>管道内</span> <span>物品流动方向的依据</span>。</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>脉冲发生器<span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span><span>这是一种输出高级红石信号的机器。除了超低频脉冲发生器外，运行时需要消耗水晶单元。输出的信号取决于用作脉冲发生器的水晶单元的性能。此外，当接收原版红石信号时，脉冲发生器不会运行，也不会消耗水晶单元。</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>水晶单元</li>\n</ul>\n<div><span><span>作为</span> <span>脉冲</span> <span>发生器的</span> <span>燃料</span> <span>的物品</span>。<span>基本上</span> <span>包括下界</span> <span>石英</span><span>、</span> <span>红石</span>，以及<span>珠宝</span> <span>和</span> <span>材料</span>。<span>如果</span> <span>水晶单元</span> <span>的最大输出频率</span> <span>高于</span> <span>脉冲</span> <span>发生器的</span> <span>频率</span>，<span>振动器</span> <span>的持续时间</span> <span>将相应延长</span>。</span></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span>红石机器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span></span><span><span><span>这是一种由</span> <span>高级红石信号驱动的</span> <span>机器</span>。<span>根据</span> <span>其额定功率</span> <span>接收</span> <span>输入</span> <span>来执行任务</span>，<span>例如物品的</span> <span>处理和</span> <span>收集</span>。<span>对应于漏斗等的</span> <span>装载和卸载</span> <span>功能</span>，<span>加工机械</span> <span>默认会从</span> <span>底部</span> <span>表面</span> <span>输出成品</span>。<span>你可以从</span> <span>除正面外的</span> <span>其他</span> <span>表面</span> <span>输入材料物品</span>。<span>如果</span> <span>其他</span> <span>机器</span> <span>能够从</span> <span>除正面外的</span> <span>其他表面</span> <span>装载和卸载</span> <span>相应的</span> <span>物品</span>，<span>加工机械</span> <span>的成品输出表面</span> <span>可以使用</span> <span>物品“</span>扳<span>手”进行更改</span>。<span>此外</span>，<span>如果</span> <span>不是正面</span>，<span>线缆</span> <span>可以连接到任何</span> <span>表面</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>致开发者:</strong></p>\n<p>源代码可从开发包中获得。<span><span>插件开发</span> <span>基本是</span> <span>免费的</span><span>，但</span> <span>请始终</span> <span>与我</span> <span>沟通</span>。<span>禁止开发将此模组的能量转换为其他能量的模组。（反之亦然。）</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span>再分发:</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>原则上不允许重新分发 jar 文件。<br>如果您要制作并分发整合包，请事先与我联系（此页面或 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/plusplus_san\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter(@plusplus_san)</a>）。<br></span></span></p>",
